### 9. Archives & compression

```bash
tar
gzip
gunzip
zip
unzip
```

Very common:

```bash
tar -czvf backup.tar.gz /path/to/directory
tar -xzvf backup.tar.gz
```

### 10. Package management

**Ubuntu/Debian:**

```bash
apt
apt-get
dpkg
```

**RHEL/CentOS/Fedora:**

```bash
dnf
yum
rpm
```

Examples:

```bash
sudo apt update
sudo apt install nginx
sudo apt remove nginx
```

### 11. Environment & shell

```bash
env
printenv
export
echo
which
whereis
history
alias
source
```

Learn environment variables:

```bash
